  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Comes Ildebrandinus de Soana, pro remedio animae suae et pro viginti solidis denariorum ab Aldrudo servosolutis, eum de servitute liberat et omnem ius dominii in eum remittit.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis heredum meorum vel alia persona hanc manumissionem infringere conata fuerit, iram Dei et beati Petri incurrat et poenam centum solidorum persolvat, et libertas Aldrudi firma permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ugolinus de Berardengis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Rainerius de Cacciaconti</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Manentus filius Bonacursi</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
